ῶν",286,61]],"But Judea shall be inhabited for ever, and Jerusalem to all generations."],["21",[["Καὶ",2,8],["ἐκζητήσω",460,157],["τὸ",1,32],["αἷμα",148,33],["αὐτῶν",3,41],["καὶ",2,8],["οὐ",12,17],["μὴ",25,8],["ἀθωώσω",0,0],["καὶ",2,8],["Κύριος",7,5],["κατασκηνώσει",805,120],["ἐν",4,1],["Σιών",334,2]],"And I will make inquisition for their blood, and will by no means leave it unavenged: and the Lord shall dwell in Sion."]]